tp:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-swiper-button elementor-swiper-button-next\" role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"e-font-icon-svg e-eicon-chevron-right\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http:\/\/www.w3.org\/2000\/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"><\/path><\/svg>\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-50 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-352b3e45\" data-id=\"352b3e45\" data-element_type=\"column\" data-e-type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-245b7786 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-elementskit-heading\" data-id=\"245b7786\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"elementskit-heading.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"ekit-wid-con\" ><div class=\"ekit-heading elementskit-section-title-wraper text_left   ekit_heading_tablet-   ekit_heading_mobile-\"><h2 class=\"ekit-heading--title elementskit-section-title \">Gracious Hospital: Your Trusted Neuro and Dermatology Care in Mehdipatnam<\/h2><\/div><\/div>\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-3cfd5316 elementor-invisible elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"3cfd5316\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-settings=\"{&quot;_animation&quot;:&quot;fadeInUp&quot;}\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Gracious Hospital, located in the heart of Mehdipatnam, Hyderabad, is recognized as the leading healthcare facility specializing in <strong>neurological<\/strong> and <strong>dermatological care<\/strong>, offering a comprehensive range of services. With a focus on <strong>neurology<\/strong>, <strong>dermatology<\/strong>, <strong>cosmetology<\/strong>, and <strong>aesthetic treatments<\/strong>, we aim to provide the highest standard of medical care and advanced treatment options, ensuring a better quality of life for all our patients. We are proud to be home to some of the most <strong>skilled neurologists<\/strong> and <strong>dermatologists<\/strong> in the region.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19db19da e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"19db19da\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-40d04ff5 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"40d04ff5\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>At Gracious Hospital, we understand that neurological and dermatological conditions often go undiagnosed or present complex challenges in treatment. Our dedicated team of experts works tirelessly to offer <strong>accurate diagnoses<\/strong> and <strong>effective treatment plans<\/strong> for a wide range of conditions.\u00a0<\/p><p>Led by <strong>Dr. M. A. Mukheem Mudabbir<\/strong>, an experienced <strong>neurologist<\/strong>, our <strong>neurology department<\/strong> specializes in conditions such as:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Epilepsy<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Migraine<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Parkinson\u2019s Disease<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Stroke<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Chronic Headaches<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Nerve Pain<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>We offer state-of-the-art diagnostic technology and evidence-based treatment approaches to manage and treat neurological conditions, ensuring comprehensive and long-lasting relief for our patients.<\/p><p>Our <strong>dermatology unit<\/strong>, under the expertise of <strong>Dr. Nudrath Kahkashan<\/strong>, a highly skilled <strong>dermatologist and cosmetologist<\/strong>, offers <strong>advanced treatments<\/strong> for various skin and aesthetic concerns, including:<\/p><ul><li><strong>Psoriasis<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Acne Scars<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Skin Pigmentation<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Laser Skin Treatments<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Cosmetic Dermatology<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p>Whether you are seeking expert care for complex neurological disorders or cosmetic skin treatments, <strong>Gracious Hospital<\/strong> is your trusted healthcare partner. We are committed to offering compassionate, patient-centric care, ensuring that <strong>hope meets healing<\/strong> for every individual who walks through our doors.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-331cdde7 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"331cdde7\" data-element_type=\"section\" data-e-type=\"section\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-background-overlay\"><\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-c